        "change": "None required. Optionally, later, drop the reviewWork branch or name the commit's work through workOfCommit.",
        "claim": "In criticClosure's new refusal, the branch that fills the real work id and attempt number from the goal-work review context almost never reaches a person. When that context is present, the caller throws criticClosure's result away and goes to closeWorkReview. On a plain commit review there is often no work target, so the offered command can carry the brief's own placeholder words U and N. The brief prescribes exactly these placeholders, the audit accepts them, and the person still gets a correct act to take. Nothing ships wrong.",
